**What I placed**

| Space | What | Points at |
|-------|------|------------|
| C‑101 | 4 call‑outs – “EDGE OF PAVEMENT” (left/right) and “EDGE OF SHOULDER” (left/right) + 1 call‑out “SR‑100” (center‑line) | Alignment SR‑100, offsets –15 / +15 ft and –30 / +30 ft (pavement/shoulder), beginning of the alignment (center‑line) |
| C‑102 | Same 5 call‑outs as C‑101 | Same anchors on SR‑100 |
| C‑103 | Same 5 call‑outs as C‑101 | Same anchors on SR‑100 |
| All three sheets | Title‑block fields – Project “SR‑100 WIDENING”, title “ROADWAY PLAN”, sheet number, total sheets “1 of 3”, “2 of 3”, “3 of 3”, scale “1″ = 50′” | N/A |

