**Observations / Work‑arounds**

* The engine resolved the alignment anchors “BEGIN”, “BEGIN@-15”, etc. directly, which avoided the need to query entity IDs.
* There were no errors; the calls completed successfully and annotating text appears on each of the three sheets.
* I used the same y‑coordinates for all sheets; if the layout already contains text at those coordinates it may overlap, but that was acceptable for this automated task.
